# The ledger MUST NOT use the union merge driver (PROTOCOL.md section 7).
# Union is for append-only logs. DOCKET.md rows are records with identity:
# two sessions editing the same row must CONFLICT, loudly, at merge time --
# union would keep both copies silently, and the duplicates would surface
# only in merge commits, where no author is looking. No merge attribute is
# set here ON PURPOSE; CI (check_merge_driver.py) fails if one ever
# resolves to union for this path, however it arrives (glob, macro, nested
# attributes file).
DOCKET.md text eol=lf
